Expert silver daggers against demons should do 2 times the damage of a
single one.
7 + d3 + 2 + 6 + d20 + d4 = 7 + 2 + 2 + 6 + 10.5 + 2.5 = 30.
So average damage = 60 points.

For Magic missiles it is 16d6. Which is 16*3.5 = 56 if I am correct.

So they are evenly balanced against silver hating creatures that are
not
resistant to magic.

If the monster resists magic then daggers are much better.
Otherwise MM is much better.

Dexterity in my opinion means nothing in the late game, and GoP also
gives 2 points extra to-hit, compared to GoDs 4-5 points. 2-3 points of
to-hit is not much in the end game.

